    "The simulated rover footprint is 0.30 x 0.20 m. Wheel track/radius, box enclosure and sensor mounting locations remain estimates. Standard campus stairs are marked impassable to this small wheeled robot; ramps are preferred.",
    "This is a route-planning/test world, not a safety-certified digital twin or a surveyed map. Do not use it to send a physical robot onto public campus pathways without on-site survey, route authorization, obstacle review and supervised validation.",
